The app company is offering $.20 cashback per gallon. So for 10 gallons, the reward will be 10 x 0.20 = 2 dollars.

Step 3: Finally, subtract the cashback reward from the total cost of the gas to get the final cost.
30 dollars (total cost) - 2 dollars (cashback) = 28 dollars.

